; Word lookup workspace
;
; Letters (5 bits each) of the word being looked up, its length ($708A), the
; letters of the dictionary word found ($708B, up to 16) and their count
; ($709B). Set by $6F47.
@label=WordLetters
g$707A DEFS $10
@label=WordLength
 $708A DEFB $00
@label=MatchLetters
 $708B DEFS $10
@label=MatchLength
 $709B DEFB $01
